{"year":"2023","content":[{"type":"text","content_text":"The 80th ceremony took place on January 10, 2023, at the Beverly Hilton, hosted by comedian <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 1400880, 'screen_type': person}\">Jerrod Carmichael</a> and back on NBC after a year off the air. <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 674324, 'screen_type': movie}\">The Banshees of Inisherin</a> (2022) led the nominations (8) and won three awards, including Best Motion Picture – Musical or Comedy, and <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 804095, 'screen_type': movie}\">The Fabelmans</a> (2022) took Drama and Director for <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 488, 'screen_type': person}\">Steven Spielberg</a>. It was the last edition under the HFPA: in June 2023 the association was dissolved and the Golden Globes passed to Dick Clark Productions and Eldridge Industries. <i>Television awards are not included.</i>"},{"type":"awards_nominees","name":"Best Motion Picture – Drama","nominee_list":[{"type":"movie","id":804095,"name":"The Fabelmans","image_path":"/meqKIZTsdSlbvv47uxvJH7Jcr7H.jpg","director":"Steven Spielberg","winner":true},{"type":"movie","id":76600,"name":"Avatar: The Way of Water","image_path":"/hm6nONQOgVpKmRK5YUX9EqfJ0NH.jpg","director":"James Cameron","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":614934,"name":"Elvis","image_path":"/iekpzEjWsT7xLwm59U8ZqMIdkiM.jpg","director":"Baz Luhrmann","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":817758,"name":"TÁR","image_path":"/yWGpEgjneDeYp6zK5c7WKbEBNO1.jpg","director":"Todd Field","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":361743,"name":"Top Gun: Maverick","image_path":"/kPbuLGVSJHATkW9fX9L3h1wM0Pa.jpg","director":"Joseph Kosinski","winner":false}]},{"type":"awards_nominees","name":"Best Motion Picture – Musical or Comedy","nominee_list":[{"type":"movie","id":674324,"name":"The Banshees of Inisherin","image_path":"/rtJtaJ3ayYJ2PdwgZpEQyBETpyu.jpg","director":"Martin McDonagh","winner":true},{"type":"movie","id":615777,"name":"B